import InfoPageLayout from '../layouts/InfoPageLayout.astro';
---
<InfoPageLayout title="Booking, Rescheduling & Refund Policy | Click Jyotish" description="How Click Jyotish handles online consultation confirmation, rescheduling and refunds." eyebrow="BOOKING POLICY">
  <p><strong>Last updated: 11 October 2026</strong></p>
  <h2>Consultation confirmation</h2>
  <p>The applicable consultation fee is shown after you choose a consultation type. A session is confirmed only after Click Jyotish confirms the time and payment details directly on WhatsApp or another stated booking channel.</p>
  <h2>Rescheduling</h2>
  <p>If you need to change a confirmed time, contact Click Jyotish on WhatsApp as early as possible. Rescheduling depends on availability and is handled personally to find a suitable alternative where practical.</p>
  <h2>If Click Jyotish needs to reschedule</h2>
  <p>If a confirmed session cannot be provided by Click Jyotish, we will offer a mutually suitable alternative time. If a suitable alternative is not available, the amount paid for that unprovided session will be refunded.</p>
  <h2>Refund questions</h2>
  <p>Because consultation time is reserved personally, completed consultations are not refundable. If you have a payment, booking or service concern, contact <a href="mailto:support@clickjyotish.in">support@clickjyotish.in</a> or WhatsApp with your booking details so it can be reviewed.</p>
  <p class="notice">Please review this policy before publishing. If you want a fixed rescheduling window—for example, 4 or 24 hours before the session—tell me and I will add it.</p>
</InfoPageLayout>
